ted":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Follow-up from #449 (worktree traceability), journal finding `d028f3cc945a`.\n\nThe Claude Code transports `fr-session-bind.sh` (PostToolUse Bash) and `fr-session-unbind.sh` (SessionEnd) have no Hermes counterpart. `.hermes/config.snippet.yaml` was left unchanged and `plugins/super-fr/hooks/hermes/` has no bind/unbind scripts, so Hermes sessions never get a binding in `IsolationState.sessions` and `fr isolation status --session` cannot see them.\n\n**Ask:** wire a `post_tool_call(terminal)` bind (same `fr isolation up|exec|down …` parsing, calling `fr isolation attach/detach`) and a session-end unbind in the Hermes snippet. When it lands, add the registrations to the expected set in `tests/unit/test_tripwire_hermes_hooks_sync.py`.\n\nThe engine verbs are harness-neutral already; this is transport only.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01MDpcGKNn9XZWBar1zXUJRV","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/issues/454/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/issues/454/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}